<title>NEW ZEALAND: Fowler appointed CEO of Fletcher Forest.</title>
<headline>Fowler appointed CEO of Fletcher Forest.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fletcher Challenge Ltd said on Monday it had appointed Paul Fowler as divisional Chief Executive of Fletcher Forest following on from the appointment of former CEO Mike Andrews to head Fletcher Challenge Ltd.</p>
<p>Fowler will take up this position on August 1.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
